WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,270 --> 00:00:02,270
If my grandfather is still alive

2
00:00:02,270 --> 00:00:04,270
He would never want to see you like this

3
00:00:04,270 --> 00:00:05,770
Take your own flesh and blood

4
00:00:05,770 --> 00:00:07,770
Go and exchange for the whole plan to win or lose

5
00:00:07,770 --> 00:00:09,770
My grandfather ignored the old lady's favoritism

6
00:00:09,770 --> 00:00:10,970
Pass Hou Wei to his father

7
00:00:10,970 --> 00:00:13,100
You will know that he is the most just and clear-minded

8
00:00:13,100 --> 00:00:14,600
If he looks at you with his own eyes

9
00:00:14,600 --> 00:00:16,100
Forced to ruin one's health

10
00:00:16,100 --> 00:00:17,100
I will only feel sorry for you

11
00:00:17,100 --> 00:00:21,050
I will never blame you for dividing things up well

12
00:00:21,050 --> 00:00:23,210
The only thing you're sorry for

13
00:00:23,210 --> 00:00:24,710
never grandpa

14
00:00:24,710 --> 00:00:26,660
it's you

15
00:00:26,660 --> 00:00:29,780
if never

16
00:00:29,780 --> 00:00:31,780
It was God who caused me to die tragically in my previous life

17
00:00:31,780 --> 00:00:34,100
The appearance of Song Yu

18
00:00:34,100 --> 00:00:36,100
It was me who struggled out of the boundless darkness

19
00:00:36,100 --> 00:00:46,200
The only salvation in exchange is don’t look at it

20
00:00:46,200 --> 00:00:47,200
own flesh and blood

21
00:00:47,200 --> 00:00:49,270
If you use your own flesh and blood, you will destroy people's hearts.
